<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="posts" data-stagger><article class="post rv"><a class="ph" href="/reading-room/wildfire-claim-after-total-loss/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 400px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pb"><span class="meta">Sep 3, 2026 · 8 min read</span><h2><a href="/reading-room/wildfire-claim-after-total-loss/">After a Wildfire Total Loss: A Steady Path Through the Claim</a></h2><p>Losing a home to wildfire turns into a long paperwork project. This guide walks through contents, living expenses, debris removal and the rebuild-or-relocate decision.</p><a class="more" href="/reading-room/wildfire-claim-after-total-loss/">Read the guide</a></div></article><article class="post rv"><a class="ph" href="/reading-room/hail-damage-on-flat-and-stucco-roofs/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 400px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pb"><span class="meta">Sep 17, 2026 · 7 min read</span><h2><a href="/reading-room/hail-damage-on-flat-and-stucco-roofs/">Hail on Flat Roofs and Stucco: What to Document and Why</a></h2><p>Flat roofs with parapets, coatings and rooftop coolers hide hail damage well. Here’s how to document it so it doesn’t get called cosmetic.</p><a class="more" href="/reading-room/hail-damage-on-flat-and-stucco-roofs/">Read the guide</a></div></article><article class="post rv"><a class="ph" href="/reading-room/invoke-appraisal-new-mexico-policy/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 400px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pb"><span class="meta">Oct 1, 2026 · 7 min read</span><h2><a href="/reading-room/invoke-appraisal-new-mexico-policy/">How to Invoke Appraisal Under a New Mexico Property Policy</a></h2><p>Invoking appraisal is mostly about reading your policy closely and putting a clear demand in writing. Here’s how to do both and pick the right appraiser.</p><a class="more" href="/reading-room/invoke-appraisal-new-mexico-policy/">Read the guide</a></div></article><article class="post rv"><a class="ph" href="/reading-room/appraisal-or-public-adjuster-or-lawyer/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 400px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pb"><span class="meta">Oct 15, 2026 · 6 min read</span><h2><a href="/reading-room/appraisal-or-public-adjuster-or-lawyer/">Appraiser, Public Adjuster or Lawyer: Choosing the Right Help</a></h2><p>Appraisers, public adjusters and attorneys solve different problems. Matching the help to the actual dispute saves time and money.</p><a class="more" href="/reading-room/appraisal-or-public-adjuster-or-lawyer/">Read the guide</a></div></article><article class="post rv"><a class="ph" href="/reading-room/monsoon-water-damage-claims/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 400px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pb"><span class="meta">Oct 29, 2026 · 7 min read</span><h2><a href="/reading-room/monsoon-water-damage-claims/">Monsoon Water Damage: Roof Leaks, Flood Exclusions and Your Claim</a></h2><p>Monsoon storms bring both roof leaks and flash flooding, and policies treat them very differently. Here’s how to sort out what your claim covers.</p><a class="more" href="/reading-room/monsoon-water-damage-claims/">Read the guide</a></div></article><article class="post rv"><a class="ph" href="/reading-room/depreciation-and-holdback-explained/" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hero-home-after-rain.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 100vw, 400px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="pb"><span class="meta">Nov 6, 2026 · 7 min read</span><h2><a href="/reading-room/depreciation-and-holdback-explained/">Depreciation and Holdback: Why Your First Check Is Smaller</a></h2><p>Most replacement cost policies pay in two stages. Understanding depreciation and holdback helps you collect the second payment instead of leaving it behind.</p><a class="more" href="/reading-room/depreciation-and-holdback-explained/">Read the guide</a></div></article></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><div class="in rv"><div><h2>Is the carrier’s number short?</h2><p>Send the estimate and your photos. We’ll tell you plainly what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line" href="/contact-new-mex